        <name>numNeighbours</name>
        <qualifiedname>MR.TriangulationParameters.numNeighbours</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>The number of nearest neighbor points to use for building of local triangulation. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Too small value can make not optimal triangulation and additional holes<linebreak/>
Too big value increases difficulty of optimization and decreases performance &lt;table border=0&gt; &lt;caption id="TriangulationParameters::numNeighbours_examples"&gt;&lt;/caption&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;<image type="html" name="triangulate_3.png">"Good" width = 350cm &lt;/td&gt;</image>
 &lt;td&gt;<image type="html" name="triangulate_2.png">"Too small value" width = 350cm &lt;/td&gt;</image>
 &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;/table&gt; </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
